  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Infrastructure for the Rural Electrification Program of Guatemala</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Infraestructura para la Electrificacin Rural de Guatemala</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general de esta operacin es aumentar la cobertura elctrica en la zona rural. El objetivo especfico es ampliar la conexin de nuevos usuarios en zonas rurales por medio de la construccin de redes de distribucin.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective of this operation is to increase electricity coverage in rural areas. The specific objective is to expand the connection of new users in rural areas through the construction of distribution networks</narrative>
  </description>
